  "body": "In 4.6.7.3 Link type \"bookmark\", in paragraph 2:\nthe text \"the section the linking element is most closely associated with\" links to \"#associatedSection\", which doesn't exist.\n\n(It used to exist, before the outline algorithm was replaced in 6682bde.)\n\nI've removed the <a> tags, but if the concept is no longer defined, maybe the phrase should be deleted.\n\n---\n\nIn 4.13.7.4 Accessibility semantics, in the \"For web developers\" block:\n\"role\" and \"aria*\" link to \"#dom-ElementInternals-accessibility-idl-get\", which doesn't exist.\n\n(Seems like it never existed. Those links were introduced in f7a3dcc.)\n\n\"role\" and \"aria* are actually defined in https://w3c.github.io/aria/#ARIAMixin, so I've changed the hrefs appropriately, but maybe you want to add entries to \"Dependencies\" and link to them instead.\n\n---\n\nIn 6.6.2 Data model, in the 6th Note, in the 1st paragraph (starts with \"Being focusable\"):\nthe text \"activation behavior\" is a link to \"#focus-activation-behavior\", which doesn't exist.\n\n(Seems like it never existed. The link was introduced in 1ab7c86.)\n\nMost other occurrences of \"activation behavior\" are simply wrapped in `<span>`, so I did that here.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11116/custom-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 10, 2025, 7:02 PM UTC (cf18a0f)\">/custom-elements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11116/30935f3...cf18a0f/custom-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 10, 2025, 7:02 PM UTC (cf18a0f)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11116/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 10, 2025, 7:02 PM UTC (cf18a0f)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11116/30935f3...cf18a0f/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 10, 2025, 7:02 PM UTC (cf18a0f)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11116/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 10, 2025, 7:02 PM UTC (cf18a0f)\">/interaction.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11116/30935f3...cf18a0f/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 10, 2025, 7:02 PM UTC (cf18a0f)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11116/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 10, 2025, 7:02 PM UTC (cf18a0f)\">/links.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/11116/30935f3...cf18a0f/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 10, 2025, 7:02 PM UTC (cf18a0f)\">diff</a> )",
